 "_about": "The token tree build_tokens.py turns into tokens.json. elevenlabs.io's public surface is a Next.js + Tailwind 4 app whose custom-property layer (raw/css-vars.json — the --f-* type ramp, --spacing-*/--section-*/--rounded-* layout vars, --eggshell page field, the font stacks and the shadcn triplets) is var-referenced where it declares a value, and measured computed values (raw/components-computed.json) cover the ink/eggshell/white neutrals, the black-pill action ramp, the state layers, the focus rings, the Waldenburg/Inter/Geist-Mono families and the pill/card radii. Every public surface painted light — no dark theme, no dark island — so the export holds core + light only.",
